-- none
#ASSERT (`Under section 4A(1)(c)(xxiii) to (xxvii), is this person a foreign regulated entity, a pension fund or scheme, a bond dealer or a prescribed person` WITH `the person is an entity or a trust formed or incorporated in a jurisdiction other than Singapore` IS FALSE, `the person is regulated for the carrying on of any financial activity in that jurisdiction by a public authority of that jurisdiction` IS FALSE, `that public authority exercises a function that corresponds to a regulatory function of the Authority under this Act or one of the listed Acts` IS FALSE, `the person is a pension fund, whether constituted in Singapore or elsewhere` IS FALSE, `the person is a collective investment scheme, whether constituted in Singapore or elsewhere` IS FALSE, `the person is an individual` IS FALSE, `the person carries on the business of dealing in bonds with accredited investors or expert investors` IS FALSE, `the person is the trustee of a trust the Authority has prescribed for this purpose` IS FALSE, `the person is acting in that capacity` IS FALSE, `the Authority has prescribed the person as an institutional investor` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- a government entity
#ASSERT (`Under section 4A(1)(c), is this person an institutional investor` WITH `this person is within s 4A(1)(c)(i) to (viii)` IS TRUE, `this person is within s 4A(1)(c)(ix) to (xiv)` IS FALSE, `this person is within s 4A(1)(c)(xv) to (xxii)` IS FALSE, `this person is within s 4A(1)(c)(xxiii) to (xxvii)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
