#ASSERT `Under section 197(1A), does my conduct contravene the bar on acts that create a false or misleading appearance, done knowingly or recklessly` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 197(1A), does my conduct contravene the bar on acts that create a false or misleading appearance, done knowingly or recklessly` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

