-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part sfac (merged by the lead; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- Cases for sfac-seat.l4. Every expected value is written from the text of the Act before the code was run.
-- A bar is asked as "am I barred": JUST TRUE means the Act bars it, JUST FALSE means the text says it is not barred, NOTHING means the text does not say.
-- The arguments of a call are in the order of the question's GIVEN; a comment above a group names them.

§ `Section 239A, section 239(8) and Subdivision (4)`
-- arguments: the date of the offer; but for 239A both Divisions apply; the Authority declared Division 1 does not apply; units of a business trust; the trust is also a scheme authorised under s 286 or recognised under s 287; also a scheme; reliance on a Subdivision (4) exemption; exempted by Subdivision (4)
-- an ordinary offer made after 1 July 2002
#ASSERT (`Under section 239A, section 239(8) and Subdivision (4), does Subdivision (2) apply to my offer` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the Authority has declared that Division 1 does not apply
#ASSERT (`Under section 239A, section 239(8) and Subdivision (4), does Subdivision (2) apply to my offer` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- units of a business trust that is also an authorised scheme (s 239A(2))
#ASSERT (`Under section 239A, section 239(8) and Subdivision (4), does Subdivision (2) apply to my offer` (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an offer made before 1 July 2002 (s 239(8))
#ASSERT (`Under section 239A, section 239(8) and Subdivision (4), does Subdivision (2) apply to my offer` (Date 1 1 2002) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- exempted by a provision of Subdivision (4)
#ASSERT (`Under section 239A, section 239(8) and Subdivision (4), does Subdivision (2) apply to my offer` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 240`
-- arguments: I make an offer; Subdivision (2) applies; made in or with a prospectus; prepared under s 243; signed copy lodged; registered; complies with the prescribed requirements; made with a profile statement under s 240(4)
-- every limb of "unless" is met
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(1), am I barred from making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the prospectus is not registered
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(1), am I barred from making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no prospectus and no profile statement
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(1), am I barred from making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a profile statement in accordance with s 240(4)
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(1), am I barred from making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Subdivision (2) does not apply to the offer
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(1), am I barred from making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- I make no offer: the bar is limited by its own wording
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(1), am I barred from making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(7), am I guilty of an offence for making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not barred, and the text names only those who contravene (s 240(5) is not asked here)
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(7), am I guilty of an offence for making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(7), am I guilty of an offence for making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under section 240(7), what is the most I can be fined, in Singapore dollars, for making this offer without a registered prospectus or a profile statement`) EQUALS 150000

§ `Section 240AA`
-- arguments: I make an offer; the securities are relevant; made with a prospectus or profile statement that complies with s 240; accompanied by a product highlights sheet; the sheet complies; the sheet is lodged; I am exempted under s 240AA; Subdivision (2) applies
#ASSERT (`Under section 240AA(1), am I barred from making this offer without a product highlights sheet` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the sheet accompanies, complies and is lodged
#ASSERT (`Under section 240AA(1), am I barred from making this offer without a product highlights sheet` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- exempted
#ASSERT (`Under section 240AA(1), am I barred from making this offer without a product highlights sheet` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not relevant securities: the bar is limited by its own wording
#ASSERT (`Under section 240AA(1), am I barred from making this offer without a product highlights sheet` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under section 240AA(1), am I barred from making this offer without a product highlights sheet` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 241`
-- arguments: I lodged a supplementary or replacement document; the date lodged (6 March 2026); the date until which the offer stays open
-- 14 days after 6 March is 20 March
#ASSERT (`Under section 241(7), have I kept the offer open for at least 14 days after lodging the supplementary or replacement document` TRUE (Date 6 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`Under section 241(7), have I kept the offer open for at least 14 days after lodging the supplementary or replacement document` TRUE (Date 6 3 2026) (Date 19 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- nothing was lodged: the duty does not arise
#ASSERT (`Under section 241(7), have I kept the offer open for at least 14 days after lodging the supplementary or replacement document` FALSE (Date 6 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 242`
-- arguments: revoked; served during a hearing; a stop order made under (1) or (2); the day served (2 March 2026); the date asked
-- within 14 days of service
#ASSERT (`Under section 242(9), is the interim stop order in force on the date I ask about` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 2 3 2026) (Date 15 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the 14 days have run
#ASSERT (`Under section 242(9), is the interim stop order in force on the date I ask about` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 2 3 2026) (Date 16 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- revoked
#ASSERT (`Under section 242(9), is the interim stop order in force on the date I ask about` TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 2 3 2026) (Date 5 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- asked before the order was served
#ASSERT (`Under section 242(9), is the interim stop order in force on the date I ask about` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 2 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under section 242(11), am I barred from allotting, issuing or selling the securities while a stop order is in force` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no order is in force: the bar does not bite, and the text says nothing of the case
#ASSERT (`Under section 242(11), am I barred from allotting, issuing or selling the securities while a stop order is in force` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Sections 243 and 245`
-- arguments: the document is a prospectus; it has all the information investors would reasonably require; it has the matters the Authority prescribed
#ASSERT (`Under section 243(1), does my prospectus contain what it must contain` TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`Under section 243(1), does my prospectus contain what it must contain` TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a prospectus
#ASSERT (`Under section 243(1), does my prospectus contain what it must contain` FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: I am an entity; I accept or retain over-subscriptions; the prospectus reserves the right; it states a limit; the amount of the issue; the limit stated
-- the limit is 25% of the issue
#ASSERT (`Under section 245(1), am I barred from accepting or retaining subscriptions in excess of the amount of the debenture issue` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 1000000 250000) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- more than 25% in excess
#ASSERT (`Under section 245(1), am I barred from accepting or retaining subscriptions in excess of the amount of the debenture issue` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 1000000 250001) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no reserved right
#ASSERT (`Under section 245(1), am I barred from accepting or retaining subscriptions in excess of the amount of the debenture issue` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 1000000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- I accept no excess
#ASSERT (`Under section 245(1), am I barred from accepting or retaining subscriptions in excess of the amount of the debenture issue` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 1000000 0) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Sections 249 to 252`
-- arguments: an offer with a prospectus; it includes an expert's statement; the Authority exempted me; the expert consented and has not withdrawn; the prospectus says so
#ASSERT (`Under section 249(1), am I barred from issuing the prospectus without the expert's written consent` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- consent given and stated
#ASSERT (`Under section 249(1), am I barred from issuing the prospectus without the expert's written consent` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- exempted by the Authority
#ASSERT (`Under section 249(1), am I barred from issuing the prospectus without the expert's written consent` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the "Where" gate fails
#ASSERT (`Under section 249(1), am I barred from issuing the prospectus without the expert's written consent` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- arguments: debentures under a debenture issuance programme; the date of registration (2 March 2026)
-- 24 months
#ASSERT (`Under section 250(3), what is the last day on which I may offer, allot, issue or sell on this prospectus` TRUE (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS (Date 2 3 2028)
-- 6 months
#ASSERT (`Under section 250(3), what is the last day on which I may offer, allot, issue or sell on this prospectus` FALSE (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS (Date 2 9 2026)
-- arguments: I offer, allot, issue or sell; the date asked; debentures under a programme; the date of registration (2 March 2026)
-- after 6 months
#ASSERT (`Under section 250(1), am I barred from offering, allotting, issuing or selling on this prospectus on the date I ask about` TRUE (Date 3 9 2026) FALSE (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- on the last day
#ASSERT (`Under section 250(1), am I barred from offering, allotting, issuing or selling on this prospectus on the date I ask about` TRUE (Date 2 9 2026) FALSE (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a programme runs 24 months
#ASSERT (`Under section 250(1), am I barred from offering, allotting, issuing or selling on this prospectus on the date I ask about` TRUE (Date 3 9 2026) TRUE (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- I do none of the acts
#ASSERT (`Under section 250(1), am I barred from offering, allotting, issuing or selling on this prospectus on the date I ask about` FALSE (Date 3 9 2026) FALSE (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: a prospectus is required; I advertise; I publish a statement referring to the offer; one likely to induce; the advertisement is authorised by section 251; the Authority exempted me
#ASSERT (`Under section 251(1), am I barred from advertising this offer or publishing a statement about it` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "unless ... authorised by this section"
#ASSERT (`Under section 251(1), am I barred from advertising this offer or publishing a statement about it` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- exempted under s 251(14)
#ASSERT (`Under section 251(1), am I barred from advertising this offer or publishing a statement about it` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no prospectus is required: the "If" fails
#ASSERT (`Under section 251(1), am I barred from advertising this offer or publishing a statement about it` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- I do none of the three acts
#ASSERT (`Under section 251(1), am I barred from advertising this offer or publishing a statement about it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- arguments: a person of s 254(3) other than (a); aware in the window; a false or misleading statement; an omission; a new circumstance; it would have been required; materially adverse; I notified in writing as soon as practicable
#ASSERT (`Under section 252(1), have I notified the person making the offer as I must` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`Under section 252(1), have I notified the person making the offer as I must` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a person the duty is addressed to
#ASSERT (`Under section 252(1), have I notified the person making the offer as I must` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 253`
-- arguments: an offer with a prospectus; an offer of s 280; a prospectus prepared and issued; a false or misleading statement; an omission of required information; a new circumstance omitted; it would have been required; not materially adverse; the person making the offer is an entity; I am a director of the corporation; I am the person making the offer; liability only because of a false statement; I made all reasonable inquiries; I believed on reasonable grounds
-- a director of the entity making the offer, no defence shown
#ASSERT (`Under section 253(1), am I guilty of an offence for a false or misleading statement in, or an omission from, the prospectus, as a director of the entity making the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the section 255(1) defence is proved
#ASSERT (`Under section 253(1), am I guilty of an offence for a false or misleading statement in, or an omission from, the prospectus, as a director of the entity making the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not materially adverse (s 253(3))
#ASSERT (`Under section 253(1), am I guilty of an offence for a false or misleading statement in, or an omission from, the prospectus, as a director of the entity making the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no offer with a prospectus: the "Where" block fails
#ASSERT (`Under section 253(1), am I guilty of an offence for a false or misleading statement in, or an omission from, the prospectus, as a director of the entity making the offer` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a director and not the person making the offer: the text names the persons of s 253(4)
#ASSERT (`Under section 253(1), am I guilty of an offence for a false or misleading statement in, or an omission from, the prospectus, as a director of the entity making the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under section 253(1), what is the most I can be fined, in Singapore dollars, for a false or misleading statement in the prospectus`) EQUALS 150000

