#ASSERT (`Under section 270(5), is the borrowing entity liable to repay the moneys I lent or deposited` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2025) (Date 16 3 2025) 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
